From 7ce6db22ff1d2e2afdaae6c9ea7754ddcd2c2471 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: XDial <xdial@local>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] magicsock,ipnlocal: add bounded connection diagnostics

XDial needs to distinguish a newly-created control client from the NetInfo
consumer it replaced, and a lazily-created DERP client from a DERP protocol
session whose current reader has received ServerInfo.

The exported snapshots contain only booleans, counts and bounded state
relations. They do not expose DERP region IDs, endpoints, node keys, tailnet
names or credentials.
